["[Regulation] (2) These Rules shall come into force from the date of publication in the Tamil Nadu Government Gazette.\n2.Definitions.\u2014 In these Rules, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,\u2014", "[Regulation] (2) These Rules shall come into force from the date of publication in the Tamil Nadu Government Gazette.\n2.Definitions.\u2014 In these Rules, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,\u2014", "[Regulation] (7) \u201cAmenities\u201d shall have the same meaning as defined in Tamil Nadu Town and Country Planning Act, 1971 (Tamil Nadu Act 35 of", "[Regulation] (10) \u201cArea\u201d In relation to a building means the superficies of a horizontal section thereof made at the plinth level inclusive of the external walls and of such portions of the party walls as belong to the building;", "[Regulation] (16) \u201cBuilding Line\u201d shall have the same meaning as defined in the Tamil Nadu Town and Country Planning Act, 1971 (Tamil Nadu Act 35 of", "[Regulation] (17) \u201cCarpet Area\u201d The covered area of the usable rooms of a dwelling unit at any floor excluding the area of the walls; change to or closing of any required means of access ingress or egress or a change tcoh afinxgtue rteos oorr celqousiipnmg eonf ta\" nays rperqouviirdeedd mine athness oe fR auclceess; s ingress or egress or a change to fixtures or equipment\" as provided in these Rules; change to or closing of any required means of access ingress or egress or a change", "[Regulation] (6) \u201c taso A inm i da r u - pt c lrtr o eae n ens d seo i uor t u r i te o so l n tyto i h n eim g t s \u201d ge retote m umthn e ped a e n rroe s arq t utuo t ri h reea e , m nhye p u np r mt o os c il de e oi, s ft s yts h,c rep o e cue f onrni,t t dy r fi, e et a nido t ci i ne n se t g dro ir bs u a ph i tao r icao enr;d s i o an ngd a o s ra idr t i o smp olav c ye o em n d t e r ni o nt l sapnadc ep,r eosrs uinre otor moveeert athney rweqauteirre mboednyt s